  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Lanny&#39;s Back</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/165\">Erik Weberg</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors meltdown swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons give &amp; take partners</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance the ring</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles pass by right shoulders</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance the ring</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons pass by right shoulders</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  petronella</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance the ring</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners California twirl ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>While the A section is pretty variable and the B section, with its iconic swaps across the ring, is what identifies any &quot;Lanny&#39;s&quot; dance, I believe this is the original version of the dance. At the very least, it&#39;s the version I last heard Erik call.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
